# Runtime artifact dirs (datasets, checkpoints, outputs — incl. symlinks to
# shared storage). Scoped to the repo root and recipe dirs: bare `data`/
# `outputs`/`ckpts` would also swallow tracked source like src/alpamayo/data/.
/outputs
/ckpts
/data
recipes/*/outputs
recipes/*/ckpts
recipes/*/data
*.egg-info
output_stage*

# Local environment config (paths/credentials); copy from upstream .env.example
.env
# CoC recipe output dirs (output_stage* above covers the rest)
output_coc_stage*
output_sft_coc

external_package/
